    // Loop invariant maintains that
    // 0 ≤ lo ≤ hi ≤ v.len(),
    // all indices < lo have v[i] < k,
    // and all indices ≥ hi have v[i] ≥ k.
    // The interval [lo, hi) therefore still contains
    // any occurrence of k.
